# Whitelist: nothing enters the image unless listed below. Keeps backend/.env, _legacy/ (old key), runs/, data and
# caches out of every build, whatever else appears in the working tree.
*
!backend/app/
!backend/requirements.txt
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
!demo/
!eval/
!LICENSE
!DATA_LICENSE.md
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.env
